hy_abort=1, sin reset y fuera de FAULT:&lt;br&gt;→ FAULT; CAUSA←11.&lt;br&gt;Bloquear transferencias inmediatamente.&lt;br&gt;En FAULT, conservar causa hasta reset." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1160" y="1270" width="490" height="145" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;CONDICIONES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;V=tx_word_valid; K=MASK_OK; L=tx_word_last; F=FULL (antes de escribir).&lt;br&gt;R=hs_req_ready; G=hs_grant; T=FINAL_WORD; C=hs_complete.&lt;br&gt;WE=WRITE_EN; RD=READ_EN; ADV=ADVANCE; CLR=CLEAR_COUNT.&lt;br&gt;Las señales de entrada solo se interpretan en su fase. No hay timeout ni reintento automático.&lt;br&gt;DONE se borra por defecto en cada posedge; solo G·T en SEND lo pone a 1. El pulso ocupa el primer ciclo de WAIT_COMPLETE." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1810" width="1630" height="170" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="FSM · Controles y temporización"><mxGraphModel page="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1950"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;DSI_HS_TRANSPORT · FSM · CONTROLES Y TEMPORIZACIÓN&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=32;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="25" width="1780" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sub" value="E = !rst &amp;amp; !phy_abort · K=MASK_OK · V=tx_word_valid · T=FINAL_WORD · G=hs_grant · C=hs_complete.&lt;br&gt;Tablas para E=1, salvo donde se indica. Con E=0: ready, req, data_ready, valid, WE, RD, ADV, CLR y done = 0." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="100" width="1790" height="90" /></mxCell><mxCell id="public" value="&lt;b&gt;1. SALIDAS PÚBLICAS · decodificación combinacional&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;text;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="215" width="1750" height="55" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pub-0-0" value="&lt;b&gt;STATE&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="280" width="300" height="55" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pub-0-1" value="&lt;b&gt;ready&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="350" y="280" width="170" height="55" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pub-0-2" value="&lt;b&gt;hs_req&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="520" y="280" width="190" height="55" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pub-0-3" value="&lt;b&gt;hs_data_ready&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#172b4d;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#344563;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=18;align=cente